# OpenMail (Limeboard)

This project's agent inbox is **hello@limeboard.app** (display name: Team LimeBoard).

Before any `openmail` command, load credentials:

```bash
set -a && source ~/.cursor/openmail.env && set +a
export OPENMAIL_INBOX_ID=fffcdc91-20d7-4297-82a0-70605b75b47d
export OPENMAIL_ADDRESS=hello@limeboard.app
```

This matches the app's public support email in `lib/config/legal.ts`.
